{%- comment -%}
  Empty media slot. Rendered wherever a merchant-supplied asset has not been
  uploaded yet, at the exact size and position the real asset will occupy.

  Deliberately a neutral labelled frame and never stand-in photography: a
  placeholder that looks like a product is indistinguishable from a mistake
  once the page is shared for review.

  Usage: {% render 'stu-slot', label: 'Hero image goes here' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="stu-slot">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
    <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="1"></rect>
    <path d="M3 16l4.5-4.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 2.1 0L14 16"></path>
    <path d="M14.5 13.5l1.9-1.9a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 2.1 0L21 14"></path>
    <circle cx="15.5" cy="8.5" r="1.2"></circle>
  </svg>
  <span>{{ label | default: 'Image goes here' }}</span>
</div>
